If you're searching for a website building company near you in South Wales, NC Digital is based in Merthyr Tydfil and works with businesses across the region.

## Why work with a local web company?

Working with a local website company has real advantages:

- **Direct communication** — you deal with the person building your site, not an account manager
- **Local knowledge** — we understand your market and your customers
- **Easier to meet** — in-person meetings are possible across South Wales
- **Ongoing relationship** — we're here for the long term, not just the build

## What we build

Every website we create includes:

- Custom design tailored to your business
- Mobile-first, fully responsive layout
- On-page SEO as standard
- Fast UK-based hosting with SSL
